        "text": "#### Ticket #1001\n🔴  **Status**: Open\n\n---\n\n\n**User Report:**\n\n>\"I clicked Buy and it just kept spinning. Nothing happened and I never got a confirmation.\"\n\n**System Log:**\n\n>The request left the device but never reached the server. No response came back.",
