        "text": "#### Ticket #1002\n\n🔴 **Status**: Open\n\n---\n\n**User Report:**\n\n>\"The seat map loaded but all the section names, row numbers, and prices are showing dashes. I can't tell what anything costs.\"\n\n**System Log:**\n\n>Seat data arrived from the server but was in the wrong format. The app expected seat names and prices but the values were empty or unreadable.",
